## Claim under pressure

SPRINT **T2** (IDs **2.5, 2.6, 2.7, 5.4–5.6, 6.2**): secret **scan depth**

| Slice | Expectation |
|-------|-------------|
| String / comment false positives | Secret **spelling** in `"..."` or `//` comment must **not** taint / refuse |
| Real sink arg | Bare SECRET IDENT (and prop-tainted names) **must** refuse |
| FFI / dlopen payload | Secret path/args into `dlopen` / FFI family **must** refuse |
| Nested RHS / field-index / method-return | Still residual completeness (not all closed this audit) |

Path-A product floor (SECRET_TAINT / DESIGN): token IDENT walk + emit-guard string-aware
`c_guard_scan_idents`. Adversarial stance: treat any string/comment hit as **FP** and any
missed secret IDENT on sealed sinks as **FN** until dual-path proved.

