## Recommended prove (OWN / rails — not all done here)

```bash
cd ooda
OODAC_BIN=./oodac/oodac
for f in secret_t2_string_fp secret_t2_string_lit_arg_fp secret_t2_comment_fp \
         secret_t2_real_arg_fail secret_t2_dlopen_path_fail secret_t2_dlopen_path_pass \
         secret_t2_dlopen_flag_fail secret_t2_concat_real_fail; do
  "$OODAC_BIN" emit-c fixtures/$f.oo
  "$OODAC_BIN" check fixtures/$f.oo
done
# expect: string/comment/path_pass → rc=0 no ERR secret
#         real_arg / dlopen_path_fail / flag / concat → rc!=0 + ERR secret both paths
bash scripts/secret_taint_residual_smoke.sh
bash scripts/secret_sink_enforce_smoke.sh
```

Close criteria for **full** SPRINT T2 (beyond this audit’s four probes):
1. Keep string/comment matrix ALLOW (no FP regression)
2. Keep real arg + dlopen path dual-path REFUSE
3. Nested RHS / field / index / method-return fixtures dual-path refuse
4. FFI free names that are sealed sinks dual-path **`ERR secret`** (not type-only)
5. SECRET_TAINT residual table stays honest until 3–4 land
6. Still **no** claim of full IFC

